//     100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
//   - optInTimePeriod2: Bars for another averaging window. Default 14; range 1
//     to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
//   - optInTimePeriod3: Bars for another averaging window. Default 28; range 1
//     to 100000; IntegerDefault selects the default.
